Z||000022||87GT||02-07-2001||02:19 PM||||I just recently put in a 195 thermostat in my car and right away they car heated right up, idled better, used less fuel, and the heater blew hot air in about 5 minutes after start up.  Made a big difference.  I fill up and get about 215 out a tank. I always fill up when its at a quarter, so it would go a little more than that.||||reg||1
